            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "doviyutief"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great milkshake recipe. its been a while since i had such a good one. the original recipe asks for milk but i used evaporated milk to create a thicker texture since other reviews said that it was a little bit thin and i am all about the thickness. also feel free to use the amount of sugar you wish because the sweetness may vary depending on how sweet your strawberries are. one last thing, i used frozen fruit and vanilla ice cream and it turned out wonderful. ENJOY YOUR SHAKES!",
            "datePublished": "2010-07-10T16:33:48.503Z"
          },
          {
