              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pingling23"
            },
            "reviewBody": "VERY GOOd although i didn't follow the recipe . I completely took out the strawberries because I didn't have any at my house and couldn't go out and buy any at the time... I did shrink it down to one serving and I did follow the rest. i think i added a little bit more ice cream (i used breyers strawberry) and I added some vanilla extract. with those changes its very good although im sure the normal recipe is good to!",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-22T12:35:09.110Z"
          },
