            "reviewBody": "I have a very good blender, it can hold up to 64 ounces and is A Vitamix. when putting all the ingredients into the blender I could barely fit them, and that was because I had half the ingredients because it seemed like it was too much. I was correct it was too much because at the end I had about two servings when I had halved the ingredients. when it was in the blender I needed to add about a cup more milk because it couldn’t flow properly without it. It was almost a solid. Finally when I was actually able to drink it, it wasn’t even that good. It’s not bad but for all the hassle it didn’t live up to what it is supposed to be.",
