              "name": "deerefam4"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Update: I made this tonight and only difference was that I used strawberry ice cream instead of vanilla. It was not anywhere near as tasty as with vanilla. I will stick with vanilla ice cream only in the future. Original note: I cut this recipe in half, and it was plenty for 3 kids and 1 adult. I used 2 generous cups frozen strawberries, 1 c. ice, 1 c. heavy whipping cream, 2 c. vanilla ice cream (we didn't have strawberry), and a little over 2 Tablespoons sugar. Yum!",
